The Hecke field `K = ℚ(α)` is degree 24 over ℚ. The LMFDB lists q-coefficients as
elements of `K`, which we decompose as `c_0 + c_1 · α + … + c_{23} · α^23`.
The combined form is `f = f_0 + α · f_1 + … + α^23 · f_{23}`, with each
